BrainQCNet artifact detection
Garcia M, Dosenbach N, Kelly C. BrainQCNet: A Deep Learning attention-based model
for the automated detection of artifacts in brain structural MRI scans.
Imaging Neuroscience 2024; 2: 1-16. https://doi.org/10.1162/imag_a_00300
Code: https://github.com/garciaml/BrainQCNet_CPU, Apache-2.0.
